{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTB撮影のとき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はOFFだったので\n昼まで寝てました...\nその後買い物しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下3足とギンガムチェックの\nブラウス買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く春にならないかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のバースデーケーキ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クッキーに名前入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ただいまテスト期間なので\nブログ更新できなくなかったら\nごめんなさい。\nテスト勉強しなきゃああああ\nうおおおん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............\n明日は\n平成24年度ものづくり立国\n「10,000人の夢王国」\nみくも、ゆったん、私の3人が\nゲスト出演します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再びの幕張メッセ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のトークライブだから緊張する"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/23/2718960/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ遊びにきてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}